Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Propose distinct concepts using the shop’s supplied capabilities and approved materials. Explain appearance, cost, durability, and lead-time tradeoffs without claiming unsupported performance; preserve essential customer constraints across creative alternatives.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
